.TH batten-ci 1  batten 
.SH NAME
batten\-ci \- Answer what this repository\*(Aqs continuous integration needs of a change
.SH SYNOPSIS
\fBbatten ci\fR [\fB\-h\fR|\fB\-\-help\fR] <\fIsubcommands\fR>
.SH DESCRIPTION
Answer what this repository\*(Aqs continuous integration needs of a change
.SH OPTIONS
.TP
\fB\-h\fR, \fB\-\-help\fR
